#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:50
msgid "Sekvo: follow-up emails"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:51
msgid "Follow-ups"
msgstr "Nachverfolgungen"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:139
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktiv"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:141
msgid "No emails enabled"
msgstr "Keine E-Mails aktiviert"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:150
msgid "Automated post-purchase emails"
msgstr "Automatisierte E-Mails nach dem Kauf"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:151
msgid ""
"Each enabled email is sent once per order, a set number of days after the "
"order reaches the chosen status. A daily background task finds due orders "
"and sends them. The order is marked before the email is handed over, so a "
"run that dies halfway through cannot quietly send it again every day."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %1$s: date of the cut-off before which orders are never followed up. %2$s: maximum emails per type per run.
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:157
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No order placed before %1$s is ever followed up, so the customers who "
"ordered before then were not mailed. That date is as far back as the sender "
"reaches, not a promise about every order after it. Each daily run sends at "
"most %2$s emails per type, oldest orders first."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: maximum emails per type per run.
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:164
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No order placed before this plugin started running here is ever followed up, "
"so the customers who ordered before then were not mailed. That moment is as "
"far back as the sender reaches, not a promise about every order after it. "
"Each daily run sends at most %s emails per type, oldest orders first."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: date the plugin was last switched back on.
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:173
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The plugin was last switched back on %s, and from that moment each email "
"reaches back by its own delay and no further, so orders that passed their "
"delay while it was off are left alone as well."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:186
msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Absender"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:187
msgid ""
"Who follow-up emails appear to come from. Leave blank to use your store name "
"and admin email."
msgstr ""
"Von wem Folge-E-Mails zu stammen scheinen. Lass das Feld leer, um deinen "
"Shopnamen und deine Administrator-E-Mail-Adresse zu verwenden."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:192
msgid "From name"
msgstr "Vom Namen"

#. translators: %s: the store name used as the fall-back sender.
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:202
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Shown as the sender in the customer inbox. Left blank, emails come from %s."
msgstr ""
"Wird im Posteingang des Kunden als Absender angezeigt. Wenn du das Feld leer "
"lassen, stammen die E-Mails von %s."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:209
msgid "From email"
msgstr "Von E-Mail"

#. translators: %s: the admin email used as the fall-back sender address.
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:219
#, php-format
msgid "Reply-to address for these emails. Left blank, they send from %s."
msgstr ""
"Antwortadresse für diese E-Mails. Bleibt das Feld leer, wird von %s gesendet."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:221
msgid "An address on your own domain delivers most reliably."
msgstr "Eine Adresse auf deiner eigenen Domain liefert am zuverlässigsten."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:229
msgid "Available template tokens"
msgstr "Verfügbare Vorlagentoken"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:230
msgid "Tokens you can use in subjects and bodies:"
msgstr "Tokens, die du in Betreffzeilen und E-Mail-Texten verwenden kannst:"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:249
msgid "When off, this email is never scheduled or sent."
msgstr ""
"Wenn diese Option deaktiviert ist, wird diese E-Mail nie geplant oder "
"gesendet."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:253
msgid "Send this email"
msgstr "Sende diese E-Mail"

#. translators: %s: order status name, e.g. Completed.
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:260
#, php-format
msgid "Order reaches %s"
msgstr "Bestellung erreicht %s"

#. translators: %d: number of days.
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:262
#, php-format
msgid "wait %d day"
msgid_plural "wait %d days"
msgstr[0] "warte %d Tag"
msgstr[1] "warte %d Tage"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:264
msgid "next daily run"
msgstr "nächster Tageslauf"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:268 src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:274
msgid "day"
msgid_plural "days"
msgstr[0] "Tag"
msgstr[1] "Tage"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:268
msgid "days"
msgstr "Tage"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:269 src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:274
msgid "soon"
msgstr "bald"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:277
msgid "Email sent"
msgstr "E-Mail gesendet"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:284
msgid "Trigger status"
msgstr "Triggerstatus"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:295
msgid "The email is scheduled once an order reaches this status."
msgstr ""
"Die E-Mail wird geplant, sobald eine Bestellung diesen Status erreicht."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:300
msgid "Delay (days)"
msgstr "Verzögerung (Tage)"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:309
msgid "days after the order reaches the status above"
msgstr "Tage, nachdem die Bestellung den oben genannten Status erreicht hat"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:310
msgid "Use 0 to send on the next daily run."
msgstr "Verwende 0, um beim nächsten täglichen Lauf zu senden."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:315
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Betreff"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:322
msgid ""
"The inbox subject line. Tokens above work here too, a name in the subject "
"lifts open rates."
msgstr ""
"Die Betreffzeile des Posteingangs. Die oben genannten Token funktionieren "
"auch hier, ein Name im Betreff erhöht die Öffnungsraten."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:323 src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:335
msgid ""
"Leave blank to use the wording shown in grey, which is translated into your "
"store language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:328
msgid "Body"
msgstr "Inhalt"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:334
msgid "Plain text. Tokens above are replaced when the email is sent."
msgstr ""
"Klartext. Die oben genannten Token werden ersetzt, wenn die E-Mail gesendet "
"wird."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:420
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Abgeschlossen"

#: src/FollowupTypes.php:22
msgid "Thank-you"
msgstr "Danke"

#: src/FollowupTypes.php:23
msgid "A warm thank-you sent shortly after the order is fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Ein herzliches Dankeschön wird dir kurz nach der Auftragsabwicklung "
"zugesandt."

#: src/FollowupTypes.php:26
msgid "Review request"
msgstr "Überprüfungsanfrage"

#: src/FollowupTypes.php:27
msgid ""
"Asks the customer to leave a review once they have had time with the product."
msgstr ""
"Fordert den Kunden auf, eine Bewertung abzugeben, sobald er Zeit mit dem "
"Produkt hatte."

#: src/Service/Mailer.php:119
msgid "there"
msgstr "Hallo"

#: src/Service/Texts.php:38
msgid "Thanks for your order, {customer}!"
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/Texts.php:39
msgid ""
"Hi {customer},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for shopping with {site}. We hope you love order {order}.\n"
"\n"
"If you need anything at all, just reply to this email.\n"
"\n"
"Warm regards,\n"
"{site}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/Texts.php:40
msgid "How did we do, {customer}?"
msgstr ""

#: src/Service/Texts.php:41
msgid ""
"Hi {customer},\n"
"\n"
"You received order {order} a little while ago. Would you take a moment to "
"leave a review? It helps us a lot and helps other shoppers too.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you,\n"
"{site}"
msgstr ""

